export anchor NoirComicStyle:
    number: 281
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Noir comic
    idea: A dark comic page cut into angled panels with cream ink borders and black gutters, halftone shading, caption boxes and speech bubbles, and one red spot colour for what matters.
    base: dark
    palette:
        gutter: #070708, the page and gutters between panels
        panel: #1b1b1f, panels and the style sheet
        panelTwo: #232328, file frames inside the list panel
        black: #0b0b0c, fields, secondary buttons and text on red and cream
        cream: #ece4d4, panel borders, speech bubbles, the current nav and the pressed switch
        ink: #f3eee4, text on dark
        muted: #bdb6aa, meta and labels
        redSpot: #ff5a4a, the only colour, captions, the primary button, Starred, the selected frame and focus
    type:
        One stack, Trebuchet MS, Segoe UI, Tahoma. Lettering is italic 900
        capitals with a hard black drop, 56px for the folder title, 20px
        for the details name and 18px for panel labels. Body 15px. Captions
        13px bold caps on red.
    layout:
        A comic page of panels with 14px black gutters. A wide title panel
        with halftone dots carries a red caption box Brightwork Drive and
        Fernhill Studio, the lettered title Website redesign, a boxed caps
        breadcrumb and a pill Search files field. Below are three panels.
        The Drive panel has a slightly slanted top and lists the five
        links, the current one cream and skewed, then storage as 64.2 GB of
        100 GB used over a halftone bar filled cream to 64 percent. The
        files panel opens with the label 8 files, Upload, New folder and a
        List or Grid switch with List cream, then eight small frames, one
        per file, with icon, name and kind, size, and date and person.
        Statuses are speech bubbles with tails. The selected frame has a
        3px red border, a red wash and a black drop. Uploading adds a
        halftone bar. The details panel has a slanted top, a red caption
        brand-guide-v3.pdf is selected, the preview with halftone and a
        light shaft, the lettered name, Starred, an oval cream speech
        bubble holding owner, size, version and shared with, and the three
        buttons. Below 1100px details drop under the files. Below 740px the
        panels stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 14px gutters, 16 to 18px panel padding, 8px between file frames.
    density: Medium. Each file is its own small frame.
    corners: Square panels with slanted edges, round speech bubbles with tails, a pill search.
    borders: 3px cream ink round panels, 2px warm grey round file frames, 3px red round the selected frame.
    shadows: Hard black offsets on captions, buttons, lettering and the selected frame.
    icons:
        2px line icons in cream. Status is a speech bubble with a word, a
        red bubble with a star for Starred, a cream bubble with two heads
        for Shared, a squarer cream bubble with an up arrow for Uploading
        and a black bubble with a checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 3px red outline offset 3px with a cream ring outside it.
    tone: Comic captions, short and punchy, such as 8 files and brand-guide-v3.pdf is selected.
